<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> "MQTT, Ontology Engineering, Sensor Ontology, Semantic Sensor Network, Message Protocol, Smart Sensor"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "MQTT4SSN Ontology"@en .
