<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology> <http://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/doernern/MQTT4SSNOntology/> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The MQTT4SSN Ontology provides rdf:type semantic model for representing the MQTT message protocol, containing the transmitted data. It extends the W3C SSN/SOSA ontology with the MQTT message protocol component."@en .
