<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicablePhysicalConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicable physical constant" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicablePlanckUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicablePlanckUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSIUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSIUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSIUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSIUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSIUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSIUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicable SI unit" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/SystemOfUnits> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  This property relates a unit of measure with a unit system that may or may not define the unit,\n   but within which the unit is compatible.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicable system" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUSCustomaryUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUSCustomaryUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUSCustomaryUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUSCustomaryUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUSCustomaryUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUSCustomaryUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicable US Customary unit" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  <p>See this page on the QUDT GitHub<a href=\"https://github.com/qudt/qudt-public-repo/wiki/Advanced-User-Guide#4-computing-applicable-units-for-a-quantitykind\">Wiki</a>\n   on how \"qudt:applicableUnit\" is computed from \"qudt:hasQuantityKind\" and then materialized.\n  </p>"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicable unit" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Enumeration> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This property associates a system of quantities with an enumeration that enumerates the base dimensions of the system in canonical order."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseDimensionEnumeration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "base dimension enumeration" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  This property relates a unit of measure to the system of units in which it is defined as a base unit for the system. \n  The base units of a system are used to define the derived units of the system by expressing the derived units as products of the base units raised to a rational power.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is base unit of system" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/belongsToSystemOfQuantities
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/belongsToSystemOfQuantities> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/belongsToSystemOfQuantities> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/SystemOfQuantityKinds> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/belongsToSystemOfQuantities> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/belongsToSystemOfQuantities> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "belongs to system of quantities" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/coherentUnitSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/coherentUnitSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnitSystem> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/datatype
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/datatype> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/datatype> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/EnumeratedValue> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The default element in an enumeration"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/default> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "default" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isUnitOfSystem> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDefinedUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/SystemOfUnits> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This property relates a unit of measure with the unit system that defines the unit."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "defined unit of system" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDerivedCoherentUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/SystemOfUnits> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This property relates a unit of measure to the unit system in which the unit is derived from the system's base units with a proportionality constant of one."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is coherent derived unit of system" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedNonCoherentUnitOfSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedNonCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedNonCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedNonCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  This property relates a unit of measure to the unit system in which the unit is derived from the system's\n   base units without proportionality constant of one.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedNonCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedNonCoherentUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is non-coherent derived unit of system" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isUnitOfSystem> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDerivedUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/SystemOfUnits> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  This property relates a unit of measure to the system of units in which it is defined as a derived unit. \n  That is, the derived unit is defined as a product of the base units for the system raised to some rational power.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/derivedUnitOfSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is derived unit of system" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#InverseFunctionalProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionInverse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dimension inverse" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionVectorForSI
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionVectorForSI> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionVectorForSI> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionVectorForSI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_SI> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionVectorForSI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dimensionVectorForSI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dimension vector for SI" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/element
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/element> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/element> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/EnumeratedValue> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/element> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An element of an enumeration"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/element> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/element> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "element" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/enumeratedValue
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/enumeratedValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/enumeratedValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/enumeration
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/enumeration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/enumeration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/datatype> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exactMatch
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Concept> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/guidance
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/guidance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  This property relates a unit system with a unit of measure that is not defined by or part of the system,\n   but is allowed for use within the system.\n   An allowed unit must be convertible to some dimensionally eqiuvalent unit that is defined by the system.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasAllowedUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "allowed unit" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseQuantityKind
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseQuantityKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseQuantityKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseQuantityKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseQuantityKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseQuantityKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has base quantity kind" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  This property relates a system of units to a base unit defined within the system.\n  The base units of a system are used to define the derived units of the system by expressing\n   the derived units as products of the base units raised to a rational power.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "base unit" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDefinedUnit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  A coherent unit of measurement for a unit system is a defined unit that may be expressed as a product of powers\n   of the system's base units with the proportionality factor of one.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasCoherentUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coherent unit" .
# 
# http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDefinedUnit
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDefinedUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
