# http://www.linkedmodel.org/schema/dtype#value
<http://www.linkedmodel.org/schema/dtype#value> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.linkedmodel.org/schema/dtype#value> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind> .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isActedOnBy> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuation> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ActuatableProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between an Actuation and the property of a FeatureOfInterest it is acting upon."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "acts on property"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between an Actuation and the property of a FeatureOfInterest it is acting upon."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/actsOnProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "In the activity (Actuation) of automatically closing a window if the temperature in a room drops below 20 degrees Celsius, the property on which the Actuator acts upon is the state of the window as it changes from being open to being closed. "@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isFeatureOfInterestOf> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuation> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampling> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/FeatureOfInterest> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sample> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relation between an Observation and the entity whose quality was observed, or between an Actuation and the entity whose property was modified, or between an act of Sampling and the entity that was sampled."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has feature of interest"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relation between an Observation and the entity whose quality was observed, or between an Actuation and the entity whose property was modified, or between an act of Sampling and the entity that was sampled."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasFeatureOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For example, in an Observation of the weight of a person, the FeatureOfInterest is the person and the property is its weight."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasResult
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasResult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
