<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation linking an Observation or Actuation or act of Sampling and a Result or Sample."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has result"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasResult> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation linking an Observation or Actuation or act of Sampling and a Result or Sample."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isSampleOf> .
