<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between a FeatureOfInterest and the Sample used to represent it."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has sample"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between a FeatureOfInterest and the Sample used to represent it."@en .
