<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hosts> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Platform> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hosts> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuator> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hosts> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Platform> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hosts> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampler> .
