<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isActedOnBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between an ActuatableProperty of a FeatureOfInterest and an Actuation changing its state."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isActedOnBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isActedOnBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is acted on by"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isActedOnBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between an ActuatableProperty of a FeatureOfInterest and an Actuation changing its state."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isActedOnBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "In the activity (Actuation) of automatically closing a window if the temperature in a room drops below 20 degrees Celsius, the property on which the Actuator acts upon is the state of the window as it changes from being open to being closed. "@en .
