<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isFeatureOfInterestOf> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampling> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isFeatureOfInterestOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relation between a FeatureOfInterest and an Observation about it, an Actuation acting on it, or an act of Sampling that sampled it."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isFeatureOfInterestOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
