<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isFeatureOfInterestOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relation between a FeatureOfInterest and an Observation about it, an Actuation acting on it, or an act of Sampling that sampled it."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isHostedBy
