# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isResultOf
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isResultOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
