<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeActuation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between an Actuator and the Actuation it has made."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeActuation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
