<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeActuation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between an Actuator and the Actuation it has made."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuation> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuator> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation linking an Actuation to the Actuator that made that Actuation."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "made by actuator"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeByActuator> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation linking an Actuation to the Actuator that made that Actuation."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeSampling> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampling> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampler> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation linking an act of Sampling to the Sampler (sampling device or entity) that made it."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "made by sampler"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySampler> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation linking an act of Sampling to the Sampler (sampling device or entity) that made it."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySensor
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeObservation> .
