<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeBySensor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between an Observation and the Sensor which made the Observation."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeObservation
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/madeObservation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
