<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between a Procedure and an Output of it."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasProperty
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasProperty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
