# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasSubSystem
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasSubSystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasSubSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between a System and its component parts."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasSubSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasSubSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has subsystem"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/hasSubSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between a System and its component parts."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between a Procedure (an algorithm, procedure or method) and an entity that implements that Procedure in some executable way."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "implemented by"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between a Procedure (an algorithm, procedure or method) and an entity that implements that Procedure in some executable way."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implementedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For example, the relationship between a scientific measuring Procedure and a sensor that senses via that Procedure."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between an entity that implements a Procedure in some executable way and the Procedure (an algorithm, procedure or method)."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "implements"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between an entity that implements a Procedure in some executable way and the Procedure (an algorithm, procedure or method)."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/implements> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For example, the relationship between a sensor and the scientific measuring Procedure via which it senses."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between a Platform and a Deployment, meaning that the deployedSystems of the Deployment are hosted on the Platform."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "in deployment"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between a Platform and a Deployment, meaning that the deployedSystems of the Deployment are hosted on the Platform."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/inDeployment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For example, a relation between a buoy and a deployment of several Sensors."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isPropertyOf
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between a Property and the entity it belongs to."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is property of"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation between a Property and the entity it belongs to."@en .
# 
# http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relation from a Stimulus to the Property that the Stimulus is serving as a proxy for."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is proxy for"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relation from a Stimulus to the Property that the Stimulus is serving as a proxy for."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/isProxyFor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For example, the expansion of quicksilver is a stimulus that serves as a proxy for some temperature property. An increase or decrease in the velocity of spinning cups on a wind sensor is serving as a proxy for the wind speed."@en .
