<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSimpleResult> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampling> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSimpleResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The simple value of an Observation or Actuation or act of Sampling."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSimpleResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSimpleResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has simple result"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSimpleResult> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The simple value of an Observation or Actuation or act of Sampling."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/hasSimpleResult> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For instance, the values 23 or true."@en .
