<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/resultTime> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/resultTime> <http://schema.org/domainIncludes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sampling> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/resultTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The result time is the instant of time when the Observation, Actuation or Sampling activity was completed."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/resultTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
