# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#ConnackProperties> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Assigned Client Identifier Property. UTF-8 string assigned by the Server when the Client did not provide one."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Assigned Client Identifier"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasAssignedClientIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "If the Client connects using a zero length Client Identifier, the Server MUST respond with a CONNACK containing an Assigned Client Identifier. The Assigned Client Identifier MUST be a new Client Identifier not used by any other Session currently in the Server."@en .
