<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasContentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Application Message content type"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasContentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Content Type"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasContentType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "3 (0x03) Byte, Identifier of the Content Type. Followed by a UTF-8 Encoded String describing the content of the Will Message. It is a Protocol Error to include the Content Type more than once. The value of the Content Type is defined by the sending and receiving application."@en .
