<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasControlPacketType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:genid130 .
_:genid130 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:genid132 .
_:genid132 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid131 .
