<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True if this is a duplicate delivery of an earlier PUBLISH message."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DUP flag"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The DUP flag MUST be set to 0 for all QoS 0 messages."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasDUPFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The DUP flag MUST be set to 1 by the Client or Server when it attempts to re-deliver a PUBLISH packet."@en .
