<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReasonString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReasonString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reason String Property. UTF-8 string providing human-readable diagnostics for a Reason Code."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReasonString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Reason String"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReasonString> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The sender MUST NOT send this property if it would increase the size of the PUBACK packet beyond the Maximum Packet Size specified by the receiver."@en .
# 
# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReceiveMaximum
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReceiveMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReceiveMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasReceiveMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:genid233 .
