<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasTopicAliasMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#unsignedShort> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasTopicAliasMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Topic Alias Maximum Property. Two Byte Integer indicating the maximum Topic Alias value accepted."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasTopicAliasMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Topic Alias Maximum"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasTopicAliasMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The Server MUST NOT send a Topic Alias in a PUBLISH packet to the Client greater than Topic Alias Maximum."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasTopicAliasMaximum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Topic Alias Maximum is absent or zero, the Server MUST NOT send any Topic Aliases to the Client."@en .
