<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "User Name in CONNECT payload. UTF-8 string present only if User Name Flag=1."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has User Name"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The User Name MUST be a UTF-8 Encoded String."@en .
# 
# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasConnectFlag> .
