<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "User Name Flag in CONNECT Flags. If 1, User Name is present in CONNECT payload."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Username Flag"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "If the User Name Flag is set to 1, a User Name MUST be present in the Payload."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasUserNameFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "f the User Name Flag is set to 0, a User Name MUST NOT be present in the Payload."@en .
