# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasConnectFlag> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#ConnectVariableHeader> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Will Retain in CONNECT Flags. If 1, the Will Message is published as retained."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has Will Retain"@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "If the Will Flag is set to 0, then Will Retain MUST be set to 0."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "If the Will Flag is set to 1 and Will Retain is set to 0, the Server MUST publish the Will Message as a non-retained message."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#hasWillRetain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "If the Will Flag is set to 1 and Will Retain is set to 1, the Server MUST publish the Will Message as a retained message."@en .
