<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DecimalPrefix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Prefix> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DecimalPrefix> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  A <em>Decimal Prefix</em> is a prefix for multiples of units that are powers of 10.\n  " .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DecimalPrefix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DecimalPrefix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Decimal Prefix" .
