<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Scale> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  <p>Scales (also called \"scales of measurement\" or \"levels of measurement\") are expressions that typically are based on scale types.\n  </p>"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
