<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Actuation carries out an (Actuation) Procedure to change the state of the world using an Actuator."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Actuation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
