# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#TopicFilter
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#TopicFilter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#TopicFilter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A filter expression (e.g., with wildcards) used in SUBSCRIBE/UNSUBSCRIBE to match MQTT Topics."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#TopicFilter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT Topic Filter"@en .
