<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#TopicSubject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A conceptual subject carried on an MQTT Topic, e.g., an Observation, Actuation, Property, or Feature of Interest."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#TopicSubject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT Topic Subject"@en .
