<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubackPacket> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An MQTT Control Packet sent by the Server to acknowledge an UNSUBSCRIBE request."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubackPacket> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT UNSUBACK Packet"@en .
