<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubackPayload> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "UNSUBACK packet payload in MQTT 5.0. Sequence of Unsuback Reason Codes, one for each Topic Filter in the corresponding UNSUBSCRIBE request."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubackPayload> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT UNSUBACK Payload"@en .
