<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribeFixedHeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Fixed Header used in UNSUBSCRIBE packets."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribeFixedHeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT UNSUBSCRIBE Fixed Header"@en .
# 
