<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribePacket> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An MQTT Control Packet used by an MQTT Client to remove one or more subscriptions."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribePacket> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT UNSUBSCRIBE Packet"@en .
