<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribePayload> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The payload of an UNSUBSCRIBE packet, listing MQTT Topic Filters to be removed."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribePayload> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT UNSUBSCRIBE Payload"@en .
