<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribeVariableHeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Variable Header of an UNSUBSCRIBE packet."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UnsubscribeVariableHeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT UNSUBSCRIBE Variable Header"@en .
# 
# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UserProperty
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UserProperty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UserProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "MQTT 5.0 User Property. A UTF-8 String Pair (Name, Value) that can appear in many packet property sets. Semantics are application-defined."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#UserProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "User Property"@en .
# 
# https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#VariableHeader
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#VariableHeader> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#VariableHeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The optional header carrying packet-specific metadata (e.g., packet identifier, MQTT Topic name)."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#VariableHeader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT Variable Header"@en .
