<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#WillProperties> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Will Properties in the CONNECT payload in MQTT 5.0 (e.g., Will Delay Interval, Payload Format Indicator, Message Expiry Interval, Content Type, Response Topic, Correlation Data, User Properties) applying to the Will Message."@en .
<https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#WillProperties> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MQTT Will Properties"@en .
