<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A type of string in which some characters may be wrapped with '$' and '$ characters for LaTeX rendering." .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Latex String" .
