<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/UCUMcs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "case-sensitive UCUM code" .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/UCUMcs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ucum.org/ucum.html> .
